[0m[32mA better approach would be more transparent, evidence-based standards that genuinely protect consumers without unnecessary restrictions. We should invest in robust enforcement of workplace safety regulations, consumer protection laws, and accessible complaint mechanisms instead. We can also support portable certifications and reciprocal licensing agreements across states to reduce bureaucratic burden on workers.
[0m[32m
