[0m[32mFrom a progressive standpoint, there are several important reasons for robust regulation. First, cryptocurrency has enabled massive tax evasion—we're talking billions in lost public revenue that could fund education, healthcare, and infrastructure. When the wealthy hide assets in crypto, it shifts the tax burden onto working people who can't hide their income.
