[0m[32mI understand this is a concern many people have, but I think we need to look at the evidence and consider the broader impacts. Immigration actually strengthens our economy—immigrants start businesses at higher rates than native-born citizens, fill critical labor gaps in healthcare, agriculture, and construction, and contribute more in taxes than they use in services over their lifetime.
