[0m[32mI'm more concerned with how we manage immigration than with reducing it overall. We should invest in robust integration programs, language training, and credential recognition so immigrants can fully contribute. We should also enforce labor standards so employers can't exploit immigrant workers—that actually protects wages for all workers.
