[0m[32mI completely agree. The tech giants like Amazon, Google, Meta, and Apple have accumulated enormous market power that stifles competition and innovation. When a handful of companies control so much of our digital infrastructure, they can exploit workers, squeeze out small businesses, and avoid accountability.
