[0m[32mWe've seen how Amazon crushes competing sellers on its platform, how Google dominates search and advertising, and how Apple's app store acts as a gatekeeper. These companies engage in anticompetitive practices that harm consumers and workers alike. The problem is that antitrust enforcement has been chronically underfunded and understaffed for years.
