[0m[32mI understand the concern about personal autonomy, but I'd frame this differently. Our freedoms exist within a social contract—we all benefit from living together safely. Vaccination isn't just a personal choice; it's a collective health measure that protects vulnerable people who can't be vaccinated due to medical conditions, including immunocompromised individuals and infants.
