[0m[32mI absolutely agree that we need to take this seriously as a public health issue. Social media platforms have deliberately engineered their algorithms to maximize engagement and profit, often at the expense of users' mental health—especially young people. We're seeing rising rates of anxiety, depression, and self-harm directly correlated with heavy social media use.
