[0m[32mThis is also about equal protection under the law. LGBTQ+ citizens pay taxes, contribute to society, and deserve the same legal rights and dignity as everyone else. Excluding them from family formation opportunities is discriminatory and contradicts our values of equality and justice. Supporting equal adoption rights is about expanding opportunity and ensuring that all families—regardless of their composition—have legal protections and recognition. It's good for children, good for families, and it's the right thing to do.<|eot_id|>[0m
