[0m[32mGreat question. Here are several interconnected approaches we should pursue:
[0m[32m
[0m[32mFirst, critical infrastructure designation: Congress should formally classify satellite internet and communication networks as essential infrastructure, similar to utilities. This triggers different regulatory requirements and transparency standards.
[0m[32m
[0m[32mSecond, mandatory governance structures: Companies providing critical services should be required to have independent oversight boards with government and public interest representatives—not just board members chosen by the CEO.
[0m[32m
